  "title": "The floor that moved",
  "youtubeTitle": "The Pendulum That Caught the Earth Turning",
  "topic": "science",
  "summary": "A pendulum in the Paris Panthéon reveals Earth’s rotation by marking its swing on the floor.",
  "duration": 60,
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "pantheon",
